{"id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch19-kappa-solutions#def:chow-iii-kappa-solution","title":"def:chow-iii-kappa-solution","path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch19-kappa-solutions.md","line":49,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch19-kappa-solutions.tex#def:chow-iii-kappa-solution","uses":["[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch19-kappa-solutions#def:chow-iii-kappa-noncollapsed]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch19-kappa-solutions.tex","label":"def:chow-iii-kappa-solution","line":73,"source":"\\begin{definition}[$\\kappa$-solution]\n\\label{def:chow-iii-kappa-solution}\n\\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0102,page-0103}\n\\uses{def:chow-iii-kappa-noncollapsed}\n\\dcref{ch19:19.7}\n\\group{Definitions}\n\n\nA complete ancient flow $(M^n,\\tilde g(t))$, $t\\le0$, is a $\\kappa$-solution\nif every time slice is nonflat, has nonnegative curvature operator, is\n$\\kappa$-noncollapsed at all scales, and has scalar curvature bounded above\non $M\\times(-\\infty,0]$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[<span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa $\">$\\kappa $</span>-solution] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a63686f772d6969692d6b617070612d736f6c7574696f6e\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0102, page-0103</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch19-kappa-solutions%23def%3Achow-iii-kappa-noncollapsed\">↗ def:chow-iii-kappa-noncollapsed</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"disp